plements an attack made with Excellent Strike; it may ignore up to (Essence) points of armor soak.<br /> <br /> <u>Speed of Light</u><br /> Cost: 1m per success; Mins: Essence 1; Type: Supplemental Keywords: None Duration: Instant<br /> Quick as a flash, Sunbeam\u2019s wielder may double up to (Essence or 5, whichever is lower) 8's or 9\u2019s on their Join Battle roll.<br /> <br /> <u>Razor of The Sun</u><br /> Cost: 4m; Mins: Essence 2; Type: Reflexive Keywords: None Duration: One scene. Prerequisite Charms: Cutting Edge<br /> Light pours through any crack, no matter how small. This Charm supplements a successful attack made with Cutting Edge; Sunbeam\u2019s Overwhelm value against that opponent is increased by (Essence) for the remainder of the scene.<br /> <br /> <u>Edge of Morning Sunlight</u><br /> Cost: 2m; Mins: Melee 4, Essence 2<br /> Type: Reflexive<br /> Keywords: Uniform<br /> Duration: Instant<br /> Prerequisite Charms: Razor Of The Sun<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10291-zeesun","user":"Zeesun","date":". 05-10-2019, 02:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10291-zeesun","name":"Zeesun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"252"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-08T16:28:24-07:00","id":1310836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeesun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1310796#post1310796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right