itting with 1 threshold sux.<br /> <br /> 16+1-10=7. The Cataphract rolls 7 dice and deals 4 withering damage. Putting him at 4i and topaz at 6i.<br /> <br /> -<br /> Round 27, +5m for all<br /> <br /> Shining Topaz (12/46m, 0vm, 0/5wp): 6i<br /> Cataphract (20/20m, -2): 4i<br /> <br /> Shining Topaz makes a withering attack. She rolls 13 dice for 10 sux, hitting with 6 threshold sux.<br /> <br /> 12+6-14=4. She rolls 4 dice and deals 3 withering damage, putting her at 10i and the Cataphract at 1i.<br /> <br /> The Cataphract attacks. Topaz spends 1m on Dipping Swallow Defense, raising her parry to 8. The Cataphract rolls 14 dice for 7 sux, missing. Topaz gains 1i, putting her at 11i.<br /> <br /> -<br /> Round 28, +5m for all<br /> <br /> Shining Topaz (16/46m, 0vm, 0/5wp): 11i<br /> Cataphract (20/20m, -2): 1i<br /> <br /> Shining Topaz makes a withering attack. She rolls 13 dice for 6 sux, hitting with 2 threshold sux.<br /> <br /> 12+2-14=0. She rolls 2 dice for Overwhelming and deals 1 damage. Putting her at 12i and the Cataphract at 0i. Topaz gains 5i for crashing an opponent, putting her at 17i.<br /> <br /> The Cataphract attacks. Topaz pays 1m for dipping swallow defense, raising her parry to 8. The Cataphract rolls 14 dice for 7 sux. Topaz gains 1i, putting her at 18i.<br /> <br /> <br /> -<br /> Round 29, +5m for all<br /> <br /> Shining Topaz (20/46m, 0vm, 0/5wp): 11i<br /> Cataphract (20/20m, -2): 1i<br /> <br /> Shining Topaz makes a decisive attack. She pays 10m for a full excellency. She rolls 21 dice for 11 sux.<br /> <br /> 18. Topaz rolls 18 dice and deals 9 damage, killing the Cataphract.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Thoughts:<br /> <br /> Excellencies are amazing, Topaz was winning whenever she was spending motes on them and losing when she was trying to recover them and stay mote positive.<br /> Hail Shattering Practice is really good, and will be bonkers at E2.<br /> Battlegroups are scary, much scarier than a single dude, but not as scary as an army should be. Numbers is basically the mundane excellency.<br /> The Cataphract needed to get lucky to give topaz a real challence, and started losing hard as soon as he started rolling average instead of above average.<br /> Against the World Stance is really good, it was the only thing keeping Topaz mote positive at several points in the fight.<br /> Fivefold Buiwark Stance did a ton of work, letting Topaz gain so much init off of blocking, I should have had her start doing that sooner.<br /> I rolled some dice to determine how the NPCs would act, the Lorelei got out of dodge when it was clear she was outmatched, and the Cataphract was willing to fight to the death.<br /> I'm not sure if the Cataphract fighting alongside the hobgoblins would have mote tapped Topaz or just given her a way to get init back easily enough to not worry about the battlegroup. I'd need more experience to know.<br /> Solar Melee is WP hungry enough that its probably worth pitching an ox-body for +2wp","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11917,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","user":"Aranfan","date":". 10-20-2019, 08:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T17:50:15-07:00","id":1342610,"title":"","content":"Okay I did a better test, and I think RFDS is actually okay in certain situations. The setup is Cathak Mora who's a good fighter by Exalted standards, and her mortal brother, who's an Elite Soldier by mortal standards, were out kind of on safari when they were attacked by a group of claw striders and their human handler. Part of the idea here is that with a mortal ally so close Mora doesn't want to go full bonfire and scorch him to death, so that's got some added tightness in the mote coinpurse.<br /> <br /> The first fight did not go well<br /> <br /> Cathak Mora<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 5/3/3<br /> <br /> 3 Wits<br /> 3 Awareness<br /> 5 Melee with grand goremaul specialty<br /> <br /> per: 14 iph: 24(35)<br /> <br /> Final Meteor 10(13) (19(20)/5 Damage)<br /> Parry 5<br /> Soak 14(11)/10<br /> <br /> All available melee charms<br /> Ox body x2<br /> <br /> -0/-1/-1/-1/-1/-2/-2/-2/-2/-4/I<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Fight 1<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].