.<br /> <br /> Mora 2i 14p 19ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 8i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 4i<br /> Claw3 9i<br /> <br /> ------------<br /> Claw 2 tries to crash Mora with a withering bite, Mora will defend with 4m Flame Born Interception, rolling 8 dice with 2 sux against defense of 6, getting only 4.<br /> <br /> Mora 2i 14p 15ph<br /> <br /> ------------<br /> Claw 1 will do excactly the same thing, rolling 8 dice with 2 sux against difficulty 6, and just hitting with 6, then rolling 1 withering damage for 2, crashing Mora and ending Flame Warden Stance.<br /> <br /> Mora 0i 14p 15ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 8i<br /> Claw1 11i<br /> Claw2 4i<br /> Claw3 9i<br /> <br /> Round 2<br /> =========<br /> Claw 1 will now try a decisive claw attack against Mora, rolling 12 dice against defense of 4, getting it easily with 6. Rolling 11 decisive damage for 6 putting Mora in -1s.<br /> <br /> Mora 0i 14p 20ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 8i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 4i<br /> Claw3 9i<br /> <br /> ------------<br /> Claw 3 will try to finish this job with a decisive strike, rollingg 12 dice against defense of 3, getting it easily with 8, and rolling 9 dice for only 2, putting Mora into -2s<br /> <br /> Mora 0i 14p 20ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 8i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 4i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ------------<br /> Arani gives another shot at finishing off the DB, rolling 11 dice against parry of 2, making it with 7, and rolling 8 damage for 4, putting Mora into -4. Mora is very badly hurt now, barely hanging on.<br /> <br /> Mora 0i 14p 20ph<br /> Bren 8i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 2i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ------------<br /> Bren will try and wither Claw 2 to save his sister, spending a willpower and rolling 7 dice against Evasion 4 for a total of five and dealing 6 damage for 2<br /> <br /> Mora 0i 14p 20ph<br /> Bren 8i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 2i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ------------<br /> Claw 2 will try to wither Bren back, rolling 12 dice against Parry 4 for 5, then rolling 4 damage for 2<br /> <br /> Mora 0i 14p 20ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 4i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ------------<br /> I just realized that activating the whole point of this combat would kill Mora, so I say fight over for the Clawstriders.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> Claw striders are scary.<br /> <br /> <br /> So I decided I needed to be a lot more proactive, so I ran it again but this time being really aggressive with Mora, while keeping her anima down.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Mora uses 2m excellency to roll 6 dice with 1 sux, for 2, totalling 5i<br /> Bren rolls 10 dice for 5, getting 8i<br /> Arani rolls 6 dice for 5, getting 8i<br /> Claw1 rolls 4 dice for 0 getting 3i<br /> Claw2 rolls 4 dice for 1 getting 4i<br /> Claw3 rolls 4 dice for 3 getting 6i<br /> <br /> <br /> Mora 5i 14p 22ph<br /> Bren 8i<br /> Arani 8i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 4i<br /> Claw3 6i<br /> <br /> Round 1<br /> =========<br /> Bren attempts to wither Claw 3 with 11 dice, making it against Evasion 4 with 5, then rolling 6 damage for 3<br /> <br /> Mora 5i 14p 22ph<br /> Bren 12i<br /> Arani 8i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 4i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Arani attacks Mora, rolling 11 dice against parry 5 for 5, and then dealing 1 damage for 1.<br /> <br /> Mora 4i 14p 22ph<br /> Bren 12i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 4i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Mora and Claw 2 clash eachother, Mora enhancing the roll with 6m excellency for 18 dice against 12, getting 12 against 7. Then rolling 17 damage for 8, with +3 for a clash. Mora enters fire aura<br /> <br /> Mora 21i 8p 22ph<br /> Bren 12i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw2 -7i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 3 withers Mora, rolling 8 dice +2 sux for only 3 and missing.<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 1 does the same, this time rolling 4 and hitting, then rolling 1 damage for 2.<br /> <br /> Mora 19i 8p 22ph<br /> Bren 12i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 6i<br /> Claw2 -7i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> Round 2<br /> =========<br /> Mora 19i 11p 24ph<br /> Bren 12i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 6i<br /> Claw2 -7i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> Mora activates 6m 1wp 1AHL RFDS.<br /> <br /> Mora 19i 5p 24ph<br /> Bren 12i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 6i<br /> Claw2 -7i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Bren will attempt a withering attack against Claw1, rolling 11 dice and hitting with 5, rolling 6 damage for only 1.<br /> <br /> Mora 19i 5p 24ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 5i<br /> Claw2 -7i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Arani will attempt to wither Mora, who will defend with 4m Flame Born Interception, rolling 11 dice and missing with 4.<br /> <br /> Mora 19i 5p 20ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 5i<br /> Claw2 -7i<br /> Claw3 3i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 1 will try to wither with a bit, rolling 8 +2 for only 3 and missing.<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 4 will do the same, but with a claw, rolling 12 +2 and getting 10, hitting. Then rolling 4 damage for 1<br /> <br /> Mora 18i 5p 20ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 5i<br /> Claw2 -7i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 2 will try to wither Mora with a bite, rolling 8+2 and getting 7, then rolling 8 damage for 5.<br /> <br /> Mora 15i 5p 20ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 5i<br /> Claw2 -1i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> Round 3<br /> =========<br /> Mora 14i 6p 24ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 5i<br /> Claw2 -1i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> <br /> Mora attempts a decisive strike on Claw2, rolling 12 dice against Evasion 4 and getting 8, then rolling 14 damage for 6, puting Claw2 into -2s<br /> <br /> Mora 3i 6p 24ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 5i<br /> Claw2 -1i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Bren will try to finish him off with a decisive strike, rolling 11 dice for 4 and hitting, then 13 damage for 6 and slaying Claw2<br /> <br /> Mora 3i 6p 24ph<br /> Bren 3i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 5i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Arani will attempt to crash Mora with an 11 dice attack, Mora will defend with 4m FBI, 2m excellency. 11 dice netting only 1 success and failing<br /> <br /> Mora 3i 0p 24ph<br /> Bren 3i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 5i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 1 will try to wither Mora with a claw, rolling 12 dice +1 success, hitting with 7, and dealing 2 damage for 2<br /> <br /> Mora 1i 0p 24ph<br /> Bren 3i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 8i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 3 is going to attack Mora in an attempt to crash, Mora defends with 4m excellency, Claw 3 rolling 12 dice against Parry 6, and failing with 3.<br /> <br /> Round 4<br /> =========<br /> Mora -5i 1p 24ph<br /> Bren 3i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> Claw1 8i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> Arani tries to decisive attack Mora, who's lost hardness due to crashing herself. Mora defending with a 6m full excellency, Arani rolls 11 dice for 5 and hits, then rolls 10 damage for 5, putting Mora into -1s.<br /> <br /> Mora -5i 0p 20ph<br /> Bren 3i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 8i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 1 tries to do the same, rolling 12 dice and easily makes it with 6, then rolling 8 damage for 2, putting Mora into -2s.<br /> <br /> Mora -5i 0p 20ph<br /> Bren 3i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw3 4i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 3 will try to wither Bren, rolling 8 +1 for only 4 and missing.<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Bren tries to return that by withering Claw3, rolling 11 dice for 4 and hitting, then 5 damage for 2<br /> <br /> Mora -5i 0p 20ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 3i<br /> Claw3 2i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Mora withers Claw 1, rolling 3m full excellency for 15 dice, making it with 8, then rolling 18 dice for 7 damage.<br /> <br /> Mora 8i 0p 17ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 -4i<br /> Claw3 2i<br /> <br /> Mora attacks claw1 again with a 3m Burning Pinnacle Strike, rolling 12 dice for 11 successes, 21 damage for 15.<br /> <br /> Mora 24i 0p 14ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 -19i<br /> Claw3 2i<br /> <br /> Round 5<br /> =========<br /> Mora 23i 0p 19ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 -19i<br /> Claw3 2i<br /> <br /> Mora will 3m 2i Flame Warden Stance on Bren.<br /> <br /> Mora 21i 0p 16ph<br /> Bren 6i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 -19i<br /> Claw3 2i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Bren will try to wither claw3, rolling 11 dice and hitting with 7. Rolling 8 damage for 7 and crashing Claw3.<br /> <br /> Mora 21i 0p 16ph<br /> Bren 19i<br /> Arani 3i<br /> Claw1 -19i<br /> Claw3 -5i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Arani will try to wither Mora, who will not spend motes to defend. Rolling 11 dice against parry 4, getting it with 6, and rolling 2 damage for 3.<br /> <br /> Mora 18i 0p 16ph<br /> Bren 19i<br /> Arani 7i<br /> Claw1 -19i<br /> Claw3 -5i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 3 will try to wither Bren, Mora will defend other with 4m excellency. Claw 3 rolls 8 dice and fails with only 3. Mora will use 4m Blazing Interception, with the Fire aura ability to allow Bren a distract gambit. Rolling 11 dice and spending a willpower, going for difficulty 5 gambit. getting 6 on the attack and then 8 on the initiative roll.<br /> <br /> Mora 24i 0p 8ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 7i<br /> Claw1 -19i<br /> Claw3 -5i<br /> <br /> Mora will use 3m excellency to enhance the attack, rolling 14 dice for 4, and hitting. Rolling 24 damage for 10, killing Claw 3<br /> <br /> Mora 3i 0p 5ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 7i<br /> Claw1 -19i<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> Claw 1 desperately tries to wither Mora, spending a willpower and rolling 12 dice, getting it easily with 6, and then rolling 3 damage for 2! Just barely avoiding a shift!<br /> <br /> Mora 1i 0p 5ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 7i<br /> Claw1 -16i<br /> <br /> Round 6<br /> =========<br /> Mora -5i 0p 10ph<br /> Bren 13i<br /> Arani 7i<br /> Claw1 -16i<br /> <br /> Bren attempts to end Claw 1 with a decisive attack, rolling 11 dice for 5 against Evasion 4, and then 13 damage for 7, causing the strider to flee.<br /> <br /> Mora -5i 0p 5ph<br /> Bren 3i<br /> Arani 7i<br /> <br /> ---------<br /> Arani fires a parting arrow at Bren, using a willower, rolling 11 dice against parry 5 for 8 total, and then 3 damage for 2. Arani reflexively moves to medium range.<br /> <br /> Mora -5i 0p 5ph<br /> Bren 1i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> <br /> ---------<br /> Mora moves to short and tries the same, with a 2m excellency. Rolling 9 dice against 7, getting 6 total against 5 and winning.<br /> <br /> Round 7<br /> =========<br /> Mora -6i 0p 10ph<br /> Bren 1i<br /> Arani 10i<br /> <br /> Arani fires a decisive shot at Mora, who will defend with 6m excellency, going up to anima 1. Rolling 11 dice against parry 7 for 5 and failing. Arani retreats another range band, leaving Bren behind, but Mora follows.<br /> <br /> Mora -6i 0p 10ph<br /> Bren 1i<br /> Arani 8i<br /> <br /> ---------<br /> Bren moves to medium range<br /> <br /> ---------<br /> Mora moves into close and uses a 3m full excellency attack, rolling 15 dice for 10 against evasion 3, and then 19 damage for 7, just barely avoiding crashing Arani.<br /> <br /> Mora 2i 0p 7ph<br /> Bren 1i<br /> Arani 1i<br /> <br /> Withering attack leaving her higher than all enemies present Mora uses 3m Burning Pinnacle Strike and rolling 12 dice against Evasion 2 for 4. Rolling 16 damage for 11, crashing arani.<br /> <br /> Mora 19i 0p 4ph<br /> Bren 1i<br /> Arani -10i<br /> <br /> Round 7<br /> =========<br /> Mora 18i 0p 9ph<br /> Bren 1i<br /> Arani -10i<br /> <br /> Decisive attack rolling 11 against Evasion 1, getting it with 4, and then 18 damage for 9, slaying the pack leader.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That actually worked, and I think I got some really good use out of it. Between reducing the -2 penalty to -1 and the free motes letting me ensure strong hits pretty much every time I feel actually was quite helpful. Also being able to wear heavy armor really really helped.<br /> <br /> I still think that as signature charms go, this one is one of the weaker ones and more situational ones though, even if I can see it having certain uses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T18:11:02-07:00","id":1342614,"title":"","content":"I often forget that Miracles of the Solar Exalted exists, and I think that's a good thing for my sanity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T18:12:58-07:00","id":1342615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342614#post1342614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I often forget that Miracles of the Solar Exalted exists, and I think that's a good thing for my sanity.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> As far as melee goes, Divine Executioner's stance is fairly rediculous. Adding 4 dice for 1 mote if you have a relevant defining intimacy is absurd efficiency. Even if its just +2 for a minor intimacy, that's really efficient.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T18:40:50-07:00","id":1342618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranfan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342615#post1342615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As far as melee goes, Divine Executioner's stance is fairly rediculous. Adding 4 dice for 1 mote if you have a relevant defining intimacy is absurd efficiency. Even if its just +2 for a minor intimacy, that's really efficient.</div> </div> </div> </div>And then you combine it <i>with </i>two purchases of Victorious Wreath, and War Lion Stance, Ready in Eight Directions Stance, and Hail Shattering Practice. Then you can sit there using Ri8DS every turn, and if enemies don't attack you, you use War Lion Stance to MAKE them attack you, and then get a bunch of motes, initiative, and decisive counterattack without resetting to base, even on your next turn.<br /> <br /> Then if you can manage 1-2 level 2 stunts in that combat, you actually kill absolutely anything you're fighting, and come out the other side with full motes and willpower, able to continue doing that indefinitely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T18:52:06-07:00","id":1342619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342618#post1342618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And then you combine it <i>with </i>two purchases of Victorious Wreath, and War Lion Stance, Ready in Eight Directions Stance, and Hail Shattering Practice. Then you can sit there using Ri8DS every turn, and if enemies don't attack you, you use War Lion Stance to MAKE them attack you, and then get a bunch of motes, initiative, and decisive counterattack without resetting to base, even on your next turn.<br /> <br /> Then if you can manage 1-2 level 2 stunts in that combat, you actually kill absolutely anything you're fighting, and come out the other side with full motes and willpower, able to continue doing that indefinitely.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That is amazing. It's actually possible to do that at lvl 1, I might actually rebuild Topaz that way. With a defining intimacy of being the best swordswoman, that would work for all attacks with a sword. <br /> <br /> Hmm, I wonder how that would stack up to 5 immaculates?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T19:00:31-07:00","id":1342620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranfan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342619#post1342619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm, I wonder how that would stack up to 5 immaculates?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure they'd have no chance. I think if you fought 500 immaculates they'd have no chance.<br /> <br /> There could be 500 Essence 5 Immaculates they'd still lose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T19:07:04-07:00","id":1342621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342620#post1342620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pretty sure they'd have no chance. I think if you fought 500 immaculates they'd have no chance.<br /> <br /> There could be 500 Essence 5 Immaculates they'd still lose.</div> </div> </div> </div>The immaculates? I'm not actually sure it would work, because Divine Executioner's Stance doesn't add to parry, just to attack rolls. I'm not sure you'd be mote positive enough to actually parry everything reliably.<br /> <br /> Edit: You'd also need at least 1 level of hardness or they's wear you down with anima flux.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11917,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","user":"Aranfan","date":". 10-20-2019, 10:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T19:29:02-07:00","id":1342623,"title":"","content":"Fuck Me I'm actually going to run it.<br /> <br /> I'm going to create 5 immaculates from Lookshy, and run the combat of them fighting her. I'm going to change her build some, so she has artifact armor so she doesn't get punk'd by anima flux.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T19:30:01-07:00","id":1342624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranfan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342621#post1342621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The immaculates? I'm not actually sure it would work, because Divine Executioner's Stance doesn't add to parry, just to attack rolls. I'm not sure you'd be mote positive enough to actually parry everything reliably.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, but if you're using 5FBS and Dipping Swallow every turn, you've got a basic parry of 8. You can bump that up to 12 for another 8 motes, and if it's just hitting you by 1 Hail Shattering Practice takes care of that, or 1-2 by Essence 2. Because you've got Against The World, using Hail Shattering Practice actually grants you a mote when you use it.<br /> <br /> The thing is, they're not all just going to be barely missing and costing you motes, some of them are going to get unlucky and roll really badly, and for those times you get a huge boost of motes, and all the while they're ineffectually trying to hit you, you're tearing them apart with decisive strikes. Even in the odd case where you get hit though, it could happen, rolling 15 successes on 19 dice or something, they Immaculates can't do much. IMAs don't have a lot of withering damage enhancers, and they'd need a lot to penetrate heavy armor. You just don't win by dealing 1-2 damage every six attacks.<br /> <br /> 500 might be a bit of an exaggeration, I imagine somewhere in there they'd get enough insanely lucky breaks in a row that your Dawn would get crashed out of Against the World, but it's a high number.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T19:34:32-07:00","id":1342625,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranfan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342623#post1342623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fuck Me I'm actually going to run it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I do sincerely wish you good luck on that, it's going to take forever. Adding multiple charm users to a fight takes a really long time, especially if you're not mega familiar with those charms.<br /> <br /> By the end of it you will certainly BECOME familiar with them though.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T19:44:09-07:00","id":1342626,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342624#post1342624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, but if you're using 5FBS and Dipping Swallow every turn, you've got a basic parry of 8. You can bump that up to 12 for another 8 motes, and if it's just hitting you by 1 Hail Shattering Practice takes care of that, or 1-2 by Essence 2. Because you've got Against The World, using Hail Shattering Practice actually grants you a mote when you use it.<br /> <br /> The thing is, they're not all just going to be barely missing and costing you motes, some of them are going to get unlucky and roll really badly, and for those times you get a huge boost of motes, and all the while they're ineffectually trying to hit you, you're tearing them apart with decisive strikes. Even in the odd case where you get hit though, it could happen, rolling 15 successes on 19 dice or something, they Immaculates can't do much. IMAs don't have a lot of withering damage enhancers, and they'd need a lot to penetrate heavy armor. You just don't win by dealing 1-2 damage every six attacks.<br /> <br /> 500 might be a bit of an exaggeration, I imagine somewhere in there they'd get enough insanely lucky breaks in a row that your Dawn would get crashed out of Against the World, but it's a high number.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The thing is, they only need to get through your parry once to make you reset your initiatiative. Then you have to hope they don't get lucky enough to crash you so they can punk you with anima flux.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T19:48:19-07:00","id":1342628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranfan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342626#post1342626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing is, they only need to get through your parry once to make you reset your initiatiative. Then you have to hope they don't get lucky enough to crash you so they can punk you with anima flux.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but they have to try and do that before you get your own initiative back up, and with stuff like Divine Executioner Stance and a Defining Intimacy for &quot;Never shall I be defeated in combat.&quot;, that's going to be really fast for you to recover back to a safe amount. Not to mention, each decisive hit you land either adds wound penalties or takes one of them straight out of the fight, so it's only going to get easier and easier as it goes on.<br /> <br /> Also note that if they're immaculates, they've got a defining intimacy antethetical to your existence, so Divine Executioner Stance gets that much better.<br /> <br /> Don't get me wrong, I'd love to be wrong about this, it's just that the only times I've ever seen a really powerful Dawn lose to DBs has been because motes are finite, and with some of those charms from Miracles your motes go so so so much further.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1121,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","user":"DrLoveMonkey","date":". 10-20-2019, 10:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T20:26:08-07:00","id":1342636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342618#post1342618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And then you combine it <i>with </i>two purchases of Victorious Wreath, and War Lion Stance, Ready in Eight Directions Stance, and Hail Shattering Practice. Then you can sit there using Ri8DS every turn, and if enemies don't attack you, you use War Lion Stance to MAKE them attack you, and then get a bunch of motes, initiative, and decisive counterattack without resetting to base, even on your next turn.<br /> <br /> Then if you can manage 1-2 level 2 stunts in that combat, you actually kill absolutely anything you're fighting, and come out the other side with full motes and willpower, able to continue doing that indefinitely.</div> </div> </div> </div>More fun facts about my group's Dawn: now that they're Essence 3, they have pretty much all of those charms, plus Single Point, plus Resistance Supernal. <br /> <br /> Solars don't fuck around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10291-zeesun","name":"Zeesun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"252"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T20:40:17-07:00","id":1342637,"title":"","content":"If anyone has already built Starting Immaculates they can link me, that would be a great help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T20:40:51-07:00","id":1342638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeesun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342636#post1342636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> More fun facts about my group's Dawn: now that they're Essence 3, they have pretty much all of those charms, plus Single Point, plus Resistance Supernal. <br /> <br /> Solars don't fuck around.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I mean at that point why care about anything really? The Scarlet Empire bugging you? Go tear down the Imperial Palace, the Deliberative, and the Thosand Scales. Immaculate Order kind of getting on your nerves? Go knock over the Palace Sublime, that should make them think twice before scrounging up one of their little Wyld Hunts. Then maybe walk into Thorns completely casually and eradicate the presence of death from it, it's got a nice view, nice palace, could be a fun home to own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T20:41:37-07:00","id":1342639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranfan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342637#post1342637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anyone has already built Starting Immaculates they can link me, that would be a great help.</div> </div> </div> </div> I can give you some, it won't take more than a few minutes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T20:46:58-07:00","id":1342641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342638#post1342638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, I mean at that point why care about anything really? The Scarlet Empire bugging you? Go tear down the Imperial Palace, the Deliberative, and the Thosand Scales. Immaculate Order kind of getting on your nerves? Go knock over the Palace Sublime, that should make them think twice before scrounging up one of their little Wyld Hunts. Then maybe walk into Thorns completely casually and eradicate the presence of death from it, it's got a nice view, nice palace, could be a fun home to own.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I mean, if you give DB battlegroups their QC Excellency in addition to might 3 they might still be threatening? Although, the only place likely able to field a battlegroup of DBs on short notice is probably Lookshy, who could probably manage a Size 3 group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T20:50:19-07:00","id":1342644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranfan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342641#post1342641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I mean, if you give DB battlegroups their QC Excellency in addition to might 3 they might still be threatening? Although, the only place likely able to field a battlegroup of DBs on short notice is probably Lookshy, who could probably manage a Size 3 group.</div> </div> </div> </div>You could definitely field one in the Imperial Palace, it has, or at least had, a standing population of DBs in the range of 1,000+. Although they'd be pretty ripe to just be cut down by an attack or two.<br /> <br /> How optimized were you looking those 5 immaculates to be? Like artifact weapons and armor for all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T21:01:05-07:00","id":1342646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342644#post1342644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You could definitely field one in the Imperial Palace, it has, or at least had, a standing population of DBs in the range of 1,000+. Although they'd be pretty ripe to just be cut down by an attack or two.<br /> <br /> How optimized were you looking those 5 immaculates to be? Like artifact weapons and armor for all?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Artifact form weapons, heaviest artifact armor the styles allow, since that's how the QCs do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T21:15:47-07:00","id":1342647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranfan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1305398-exalted-arena?p=1342646#post1342646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Artifact form weapons, heaviest artifact armor the styles allow, since that's how the QCs do.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well here's the basics anyway. I don't think I forgot anything vital.<br /> <br /> <br /> Air<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"